abstract: "Offline, dependency-free command-line linter for a Persian .docx: half-spaces, Arabic letters, digit sets, punctuation, and the font, size, bold, margins, captions and page numbers Word keeps underneath. Writes a safe fix to a copy; heuristics, not an official validator."
